<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error petlis-empty"><image class="empty-icon" src="/assets/icons/brand-empty.png" mode="aspectFit" /><view class="petlis-empty-text">{{error}}</view><button class="petlis-btn petlis-btn-outline" bindtap="retry" disabled="{{busy}}">{{errorAction==='save'?'重试保存':'重新加载'}}</button></view><view wx:if="{{form}}" class="card petlis-list-card"><view wx:for="{{fields}}" wx:key="key" class="line"><text>{{item.name}}</text><switch disabled="{{busy}}" checked="{{form[item.key]}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindchange="change" color="#0D6E6E"/></view></view><view class="card petlis-list-card" aria-label="使用统计设置"><view class="line analytics-choice"><view><view class="setting-title">使用情况统计</view><text class="setting-meta">本机设置 · 即时保存</text></view><switch aria-label="使用情况统计" checked="{{analyticsSettings.enabled}}" disabled="{{!analyticsSettings.available}}" bindchange="changeAnalytics" color="#0D6E6E" /></view><view class="hint">只统计操作步骤和结果，不记录姓名、手机号或诊疗内容。关闭后停止采集并清除待发记录，不影响送检和业务通知；已送达的统计不会自动删除。此设置在本机生效，切换账号后仍保留。</view><view wx:if="{{!analyticsSettings.available}}" class="setting-meta">当前版本未开放使用统计。</view><view wx:if="{{analyticsError}}" class="analytics-error" role="alert">{{analyticsError}}</view></view>
<view class="card petlis-list-card"><view>本机错误诊断</view><view class="hint">仅在这台设备保留最近20条错误的类型、页面和代码位置，不记录填写内容或登录凭据，不自动上传。</view><view class="card-actions"><button class="petlis-btn petlis-btn-outline" bindtap="copyDiagnostics">复制诊断记录</button><button class="petlis-btn petlis-btn-danger" bindtap="clearDiagnostics">清除诊断记录</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{form}}" class="bottom-actions"><button class="petlis-btn petlis-btn-primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="save"><image class="button-icon" src="/assets/icons/brand-settings.png" mode="aspectFit" />保存通知设置</button></view></view>